♪ <i>I've been trying to
Reel you in for so long</i> ♪

1175
01:20:59.222 --> 01:21:03.014
♪ <i>Now I'm tired of
Sitting around and waiting</i> ♪

1176
01:21:03.139 --> 01:21:06.972
♪ <i>I don't want my youth
To go waste</i> ♪

1177
01:21:07.097 --> 01:21:10.347
♪ <i>Come, let me whisper to you
How I feel</i> ♪

1178
01:21:10.472 --> 01:21:13.972
♪ <i>Why do you look away from me?</i> ♪

1179
01:21:14.431 --> 01:21:18.306
♪ <i>Love me little-little
