1182
01:21:25.722 --> 01:21:29.431
♪ <i>Love me little-little
Little-little...</i> ♪

1183
01:21:32.806 --> 01:21:37.806
♪ <i>Hey, you're too drunk right now</i> ♪

1184
01:21:37.931 --> 01:21:41.389
♪ <i>Don't get carried away</i> ♪

1185
01:21:41.514 --> 01:21:45.014
♪ <i>My lover is standing right here</i> ♪

1186
